/* 区域探索事件库 卷2 / 机括城·修道院·温室庄园 / 零编号命名 */

:: MP Region Clockwork CoolingTowerTube [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">>
<<effects>>
蒸汽压力室西侧的副冷却塔排污口卡着一只防水铜筒，四周笼罩着淡淡的白雾。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
<<if ($stress or 0) gte 3500>>你深呼吸稳住心神。<<else>>你全神贯注地观察。<</if>>
你在夹层与暗槽间摸到了一枚保存完好的旧银币与信物线索。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[细致探查 (0:05)|MP Region Clockwork Steam]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -4>><<money 250>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[巧妙开启暗格 (0:06)|MP Region Clockwork Steam]]>><<pass 6>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<skulduggery 2>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回主区域 (0:02)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

:: MP Region Clockwork BrokenGaugeTin [nobr]
